{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21811","headline":"有酒十章 五 · 元稹","name":"有酒十章 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有酒有酒香满尊，君宁不饮开君颜。\n岂不知君饮此心恨，君今独醒谁与言。\n君宁不见飓风翻海火燎原，巨鳌唐突高焰延。\n精卫衔芦塞海溢，枯鱼喷沫救池燔。\n筋疲力竭波更大，鳍燋甲裂身已乾。\n有翼劝尔升九天，有鳞劝尔登龙门。\n九天下视日月转，龙门上激雷雨奔。\n螗蜋虽怒谁尔惧，鶡旦虽啼谁尔怜。\n抟空意远风来壮，我可奈何兮一杯又进消我烦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21811.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21811","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}